    "detailed_description": "DEAD PETALS BLISS is an infinitely replayable twin-stick shooty from the creators of DEAD PETALS and satryn, built from the ground up in our advanced 2D engine \ud83c\udf38<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEVER THE SAME AGAIN.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique enemy roster every run, each with its own behavior, bullet pattern, and occasional mental illness.<br></li><li>Attempt the Antipetal Altar solo or with a friend in couch co-op, each mode with its own leaderboard.<br></li><li>An original soundtrack by Casey William (@ENNWAY on YouTube and Spotify), the composer of the satryn theme.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWERED BY PETALS.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Supports massive flocks of bullets and baddies that slice and stir a vibrant fluid simulation.<br></li><li>Super-smooth bullet-time moments that make you feel like the protagonist from a certain 1999 action movie.<br></li><li>Gentle with low-powered machines. Hyper-charged on high-end hardware.<br></li><li>Supports high refresh rates and ultra-wide displays.</li></ul>",
